  "display_title": "Celeb Lady",
  "description": "One moment, world-famous celebrity Juliet Karenina is on top. Next, she wakes up in another world as Rubetria Diolus, a noble girl abused and cast aside by her own family. With Wisht, the Spirit of Wishes, she relives Rubetria’s memories and learns her step-grandmother spent years ruining her life to seize her house, name, and future. Now that she knows the truth, Juliet refuses to suffer in silence, and she’s ready to launch Rubetria into a dazzling new life as the empire’s brightest celebrity!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
